{"seq":1,"slug":"project-structure","title":"项目结构与包管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/engineering/project-structure","wordCount":913,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"项目结构与包管理\">项目结构与包管理</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>现代 Python 项目以 <code>pyproject.toml</code> 为核心配置文件，以虚拟环境隔离依赖，以 uv/pip 管理包。合理的项目结构和包管理实践是团队协作和 CI/CD 的基础。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个 Python 项目的工程化能力由四个决策支撑，它们的好坏会贯穿开发、协作与交付全过程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;pyproject.toml&lt;br/&gt;元数据 + 工具配置单一来源&quot;] --&gt; B{布局选择}&#10;  B -- 发布到 PyPI / 有 C 扩展 --&gt; C[&quot;src layout&lt;br/&gt;强制先安装再导入&quot;]&#10;  B -- 小项目 / 脚本 --&gt; D[&quot;flat layout&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; E[&quot;虚拟环境&lt;br/&gt;隔离依赖&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;包管理器&lt;br/&gt;pip / uv / poetry / pdm&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;锁文件&lt;br/&gt;可复现构建&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; H[&quot;质量门禁&lt;br/&gt;ruff + mypy + pytest&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I[&quot;pre-commit / CI&lt;br/&gt;提交即验&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"pyproject.toml&lt;br/&gt;元数据 + 工具配置单一来源\"] --&gt; B{布局选择}\n  B -- 发布到 PyPI / 有 C 扩展 --&gt; C[\"src layout&lt;br/&gt;强制先安装再导入\"]\n  B -- 小项目 / 脚本 --&gt; D[\"flat layout\"]\n  A --&gt; E[\"虚拟环境&lt;br/&gt;隔离依赖\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"包管理器&lt;br/&gt;pip / uv / poetry / pdm\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"锁文件&lt;br/&gt;可复现构建\"]\n  A --&gt; H[\"质量门禁&lt;br/&gt;ruff + mypy + pytest\"]\n  H --&gt; I[\"pre-commit / CI&lt;br/&gt;提交即验\"]</pre><p>其中最关键的两条设计取舍：<strong>src layout 的价值在于防御</strong>——它强制开发者先 <code>pip install -e .</code> 再导入，避免&quot;意外引用本地源码而非已安装包&quot;，在有 C 扩展的项目里尤其重要；<strong>pyproject.toml 的价值在于收敛</strong>——它把过去分散的 <code>setup.py</code> / <code>setup.cfg</code> / <code>requirements.txt</code> 统一为单一来源（PEP 621 标准化）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"标准项目结构\">标准项目结构</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"my-project/&#10;├── pyproject.toml&#10;├── README.md&#10;├── LICENSE&#10;├── src/&#10;│   └── my_project/&#10;│       ├── __init__.py&#10;│       ├── core.py&#10;│       └── utils.py&#10;├── tests/&#10;│   ├── __init__.py&#10;│   ├── test_core.py&#10;│   └── test_utils.py&#10;├── docs/&#10;└── scripts/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>my-project/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── pyproject.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── README.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── LICENSE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── my_project/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── __init__.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── core.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── utils.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── tests/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── __init__.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── test_core.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── test_utils.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── docs/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── scripts/</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"src-layout-vs-flat-layout\">src layout vs flat layout</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>布局</th>\n<th>目录结构</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>src layout</td>\n<td><code>src/my_project/</code></td>\n<td>避免意外导入本地未安装的包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>flat layout</td>\n<td><code>my_project/</code></td>\n<td>简单直接，小项目适用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>src layout 的核心优势是强制开发者通过 <code>pip install -e .</code> 安装包后再使用，避免&quot;在项目根目录下运行测试时意外导入了本地源码而非安装后的包&quot;的问题。这个差异在有 C 扩展的项目中尤为关键——flat layout 可能导致测试运行的是纯 Python 版本而非编译后的版本。对于库（发布到 PyPI 的包），强烈推荐 src layout。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"pyproject-toml\">pyproject.toml</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[project]&#10;name = &quot;my-project&quot;&#10;version = &quot;0.1.0&quot;&#10;description = &quot;A sample Python project&quot;&#10;requires-python = &quot;&gt;=3.11&quot;&#10;dependencies = [&#10;    &quot;httpx&gt;=0.27&quot;,&#10;    &quot;pydantic&gt;=2.0&quot;,&#10;]&#10;&#10;[project.optional-dependencies]&#10;dev = [&#10;    &quot;pytest&gt;=8.0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;ruff&gt;=0.4&quot;,&#10;    &quot;mypy&gt;=1.10&quot;,&#10;]&#10;&#10;[build-system]&#10;requires = [&quot;hatchling&quot;]&#10;build-backend = &quot;hatchling.build&quot;&#10;&#10;[tool.ruff]&#10;line-length = 100&#10;target-version = &quot;py311&quot;&#10;&#10;[tool.ruff.lint]&#10;select = [&quot;E&quot;, &quot;F&quot;, &quot;I&quot;, &quot;N&quot;, &quot;UP&quot;]&#10;&#10;[tool.mypy]&#10;strict = true&#10;&#10;[tool.pytest.ini_options]&#10;testpaths = [&quot;tests&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[project]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name = \"my-project\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>version = \"0.1.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>description = \"A sample Python project\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>requires-python = \">=3.11\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dependencies = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"httpx>=0.27\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"pydantic>=2.0\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[project.optional-dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dev = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"pytest>=8.0\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"ruff>=0.4\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"mypy>=1.10\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[build-system]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>requires = [\"hatchling\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>build-backend = \"hatchling.build\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[tool.ruff]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>line-length = 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>target-version = \"py311\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[tool.ruff.lint]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>select = [\"E\", \"F\", \"I\", \"N\", \"UP\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[tool.mypy]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>strict = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[tool.pytest.ini_options]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>testpaths = [\"tests\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>pyproject.toml</code> 统一了项目元数据、构建配置和工具配置。在此之前，Python 项目需要维护 <code>setup.py</code>、<code>setup.cfg</code>、<code>requirements.txt</code>、<code>MANIFEST.in</code> 等多个文件，配置分散且容易不一致。PEP 621 标准化了 <code>[project]</code> 表的字段定义，使得不同构建后端可以读取相同的元数据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"构建后端对比\">构建后端对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>后端</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>hatchling</td>\n<td>快速、配置简洁</td>\n<td>纯 Python 项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>setuptools</td>\n<td>最广泛支持</td>\n<td>传统项目迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>flit</td>\n<td>极简</td>\n<td>简单库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>maturin</td>\n<td>Rust 扩展支持</td>\n<td>Python + Rust</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"虚拟环境\">虚拟环境</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"python -m venv .venv&#10;source .venv/bin/activate&#10;pip install -e &quot;.[dev]&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">python</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> venv</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .venv</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .venv/bin/activate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \".[dev]\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"包管理工具对比\">包管理工具对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>锁文件</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>pip</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>标准工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>uv</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>uv.lock</td>\n<td>Rust 实现，pip 兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>poetry</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>poetry.lock</td>\n<td>一体化管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pdm</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>pdm.lock</td>\n<td>PEP 标准优先</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"uv-使用\">uv 使用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pip install uv&#10;uv venv&#10;uv pip install -e &quot;.[dev]&quot;&#10;uv pip compile requirements.in -o requirements.txt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> uv</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">uv</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> venv</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">uv</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \".[dev]\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">uv</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compile</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> requirements.in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> requirements.txt</span></span></code></pre></div><p>uv 是 Astral（ruff 的开发公司）推出的 Python 包管理器，用 Rust 编写，解析和安装速度比 pip 快 10-100 倍。它完全兼容 pip 的命令行接口，支持 <code>requirements.txt</code> 和 <code>pyproject.toml</code>，可以直接替换 pip 使用。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"linting-与格式化\">Linting 与格式化</h2><h3 id=\"ruff-全能-linter\">Ruff：全能 linter</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"ruff check src/ --fix&#10;ruff format src/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ruff</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --fix</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ruff</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> format</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Ruff 使用 Rust 编写，速度是 flake8 的 10-100 倍，可以替代 flake8 + isort + pyupgrade + autoflake。</p>\n<h3 id=\"工具链速查\">工具链速查</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>替代对象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ruff</td>\n<td>Linting + 格式化</td>\n<td>flake8 + black + isort</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mypy</td>\n<td>类型检查</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pyright</td>\n<td>类型检查</td>\n<td>mypy（更快）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pre-commit</td>\n<td>Git 钩子</td>\n<td>手动运行 lint</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"pre-commit-配置\">pre-commit 配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"repos:&#10;  - repo: https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff-pre-commit&#10;    rev: v0.4.0&#10;    hooks:&#10;      - id: ruff&#10;        args: [--fix]&#10;      - id: ruff-format&#10;  - repo: https://github.com/pre-commit/mirrors-mypy&#10;    rev: v1.10.0&#10;    hooks:&#10;      - id: mypy\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">repos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">repo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff-pre-commit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v0.4.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    hooks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ruff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--fix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ruff-format</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">repo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://github.com/pre-commit/mirrors-mypy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1.10.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    hooks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">mypy</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pip install pre-commit&#10;pre-commit install&#10;pre-commit run --all-files\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pre-commit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pre-commit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pre-commit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --all-files</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"ci-cd-集成\">CI/CD 集成</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: CI&#10;on: [push, pull_request]&#10;jobs:&#10;  test:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-python@v5&#10;        with:&#10;          python-version: &#39;3.12&#39;&#10;      - run: pip install uv &amp;&amp; uv pip install -e &quot;.[dev]&quot;&#10;      - run: ruff check src/&#10;      - run: mypy src/&#10;      - run: pytest --cov\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-python@v5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          python-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3.12'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pip install uv &#x26;&#x26; uv pip install -e \".[dev]\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ruff check src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">mypy src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pytest --cov</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>始终使用 <code>pyproject.toml</code> 作为项目配置的单一来源</li>\n<li>使用 src layout 避免开发时意外导入未安装的包</li>\n<li>锁定依赖版本（uv.lock / requirements.txt）确保可复现构建</li>\n<li>在 CI 中运行 ruff + mypy + pytest 三重质量门禁</li>\n<li>使用 pre-commit 在提交前自动检查代码质量</li>\n<li>区分 <code>dependencies</code>（运行时）和 <code>optional-dependencies</code>（开发时），保持生产依赖精简</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>现代 Python 项目以 <code>pyproject.toml</code> 为配置单一来源，由虚拟环境隔离依赖。</li>\n<li>src layout 是防御性选择：强制先安装再导入，避免误引本地源码，库项目应优先采用。</li>\n<li>构建后端按需选型：hatchling（纯 Python）、setuptools（迁移）、maturin（Rust 扩展）。</li>\n<li>包管理器对比：uv 极快且 pip 兼容，pip 标准，poetry / pdm 一体化并带锁文件。</li>\n<li>质量门禁由 ruff（lint + 格式化）、mypy、pytest 组成，通过 pre-commit 与 CI 落地。</li>\n<li>锁依赖版本、精简生产依赖，是保证可复现构建的关键。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"项目结构与包管理","id":"项目结构与包管理"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"标准项目结构","id":"标准项目结构"},{"level":3,"text":"src layout vs flat layout","id":"src-layout-vs-flat-layout"},{"level":2,"text":"pyproject.toml","id":"pyproject-toml"},{"level":3,"text":"构建后端对比","id":"构建后端对比"},{"level":2,"text":"虚拟环境","id":"虚拟环境"},{"level":3,"text":"包管理工具对比","id":"包管理工具对比"},{"level":3,"text":"uv 使用","id":"uv-使用"},{"level":2,"text":"Linting 与格式化","id":"linting-与格式化"},{"level":3,"text":"Ruff：全能 linter","id":"ruff-全能-linter"},{"level":3,"text":"工具链速查","id":"工具链速查"},{"level":2,"text":"pre-commit 配置","id":"pre-commit-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"CI/CD 集成","id":"ci-cd-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Jupyter 与交互式分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/data-science/jupyter"},"next":{"title":"测试框架 pytest","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/engineering/pytest"}}